cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Approval Binding Vectors (ABV): a protocol-neutral conformance corpus"
abstract: >-
  A protocol-neutral conformance corpus for one question: does this record prove
  that what executed is what was approved? Defines six predicates (action,
  arguments, dereference, freshness, authority, single use), twelve vectors of
  which three are positive controls, a dependency-free reference checker, and an
  isolation test demonstrating that each negative vector violates exactly its
  designated predicate. Every predicate has an observed referent in a published
  specification. Not peer-reviewed.
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
authors:
